# Shell scripts must stay LF: a default Git-for-Windows clone
# (core.autocrlf=true) would otherwise check them out with CRLF, and
# bash fails on 'set -euo pipefail\r' — breaking scripts/init-env.sh
# for exactly the Windows users the README points at it, and
# backend/entrypoint.sh inside the Linux images when built from such
# a clone.
*.sh text eol=lf
